      "LessonExamBinding": {
        "description": "#124: the precheck of «Отменить урок» on the lesson sheet.  ``state`` / ``title`` as ``examBinding``; ``canCancel`` / ``message`` = the answer of the SAME\n``cancellation-check`` of exam-service that refuses the cancellation itself (an exam that is launched OR has attempts blocks it).",
